# Tilt! (levels/solo/tilt.txt): the pinball machine without a death. Format: src/capture/timeline.rs.
# Up A, the drain and R2/R3, the wide shaft's bottom door onto the old pedestal (checkpoint),
# up the tower of doors and out of its middle one, then jump and toot across into the cushion
# shaft (walk in and it's the sewage), out of its top door and over the light-up bridge.
wait 0.5
hold Right Space 300ms
hold Right 2.6
wait 0.45
hold Right 3.5
hold Left 2.4
hold Right 2.6
hold Left 2.5
hold Right 0.9
wait 0.3
hold Right Space 250ms
hold Right 0.1
hold Right Space 200ms
hold Right 2.8
wait 0.3
hold Right Space 250ms
hold Right 0.1
wait 0.7
hold Right 0.2
hold Right Space 300ms
hold Right 0.1
wait 0.9
hold Right Space 300ms
hold Right 0.1
wait 0.9
hold Right Space 300ms
hold Right 0.1
wait 0.9
hold Right Space 300ms
hold Right 0.1
hold Right 1
wait 1
